cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BAT-GLIMPSE, please cite the software and the associated paper."
title: "BAT-GLIMPSE"
type: software
version: 0.1.7
date-released: "2026-07-16"
abstract: >-
  BAT-GLIMPSE is an open-source Swift/BAT localization pipeline for transient gamma-ray
  sources. It combines coded-mask imaging and mosaic techniques to recover arcminute-scale
  positions during both normal pointings and spacecraft slews, enabling rapid follow-up of
  short transients and multi-messenger counterparts.
authors:
